                <pb facs="0588" n="538" xml:id="pg538"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-02-13"><hi rendition="#italic">February 13,
                        1894</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received February 28.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 189.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your dispatch 149, relative to
                    the alleged assistance of Jewish emigrants to the United States, I have the
                    honor to inform you that I have this day received a note from the imperial
                    foreign office stating that this report is absolutely without foundation.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Andrew D. White.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
